### Create wallet
POST http://localhost:8080/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "Felipe",
  "initialBalance": 1000
}

### Get wallet by id
GET http://localhost:8080/wallets/f8363bdb-b0c0-4d0c-9ebd-4f58612fdfcc

### Create wallet - zero balance
POST http://localhost:8080/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner_id": "fb2a651b-bf82-43c2-adbf-510b0df96014",
  "initial_balance": 0
}

### Create wallet - missing owner id (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner_id": "",
  "initial_balance": 500
}

### Get wallet - not found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/wallets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
